SUMMARY:FREE Showing of "The Odyssey" Film by Christopher Nolan at the Clairidge
DESCRIPTION:The Friends of the Glen Ridge Public Library are sponsoring a 
 FREE viewing of the NEW Christopher Nolan film "The Odyssey" at The 
 Clairidge in Montclair (486 Bloomfield Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ). Doors open 
 at 6PM\, the movie begins promptly at 6:30PM (NO TRAILERS) and has a run 
 time of just under 3 hours. Please be at the theatre no later than 6:20PM 
 or your seat may be given away to a member of the wait 
 list.\n\nREGISTRATION IS REQUIRED and is restricted to Glen Ridge library 
 card holders. If you register but cannot attend\, please cancel your 
 registration or let us know before the event as we are anticipating a wait 
 list. If you are on the wait list\, we will let people in on a first 
 come-first served basis starting at 6:20PM. \n\nThis is an adult program as 
 the movie is rated R.\n\nRefreshments will be available for purchase at the 
 concession stand.\n\nThe movie will be shown with English subtitles for 
 accessibility.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Movie
UID:LibCal-10286-17111541
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17111541
