SUMMARY:Library Chef: How to Hide Those Veggies - Parent Nutrition Tips
DESCRIPTION:Tired of the dinnertime veggie battles? Discover clever\, 
 creative ways to sneak more nutrition into everyday meals your kids will 
 actually love. Packed with practical tups on reading labels\, hiding 
 vegetables in favorite dishes\, and building balanced nutrition for the 
 whole family\, all while keeping mealtime fun and stress free.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Class
