SUMMARY:Intuitive Tarot - Teen & Adult
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Monday September 28th to learn to interpret the 
 imagery of the Tarot to awaken your intuition in order to start reading for 
 yourself and others.\n\nTeen   Adult Program | grades 6  | Registration 
 Required\nGlen Ridge patron priority\n\nAbout the Instructor: Tara 
 Ryazansky has been reading Tarot for a decade. She started @tarot2thepeople 
 in 2025. This project aims to make Tarot welcoming\, free and accessible at 
 public libraries across New Jersey.
