BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261007T194500Z
DTEND:20261007T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261007T000000Z
SUMMARY:Branching Out Story Time
DESCRIPTION:Enter your child's name as well as their age in the "Child's 
 Age" line.\n\nYour 3-5 year old is ready to Branch Out and participate in 
 this “on my own” story time class.\n\nIt’s time to explore the world! 
 Science\, art\, math\, and stories come together to encourage language and 
 literacy skills\, sharing and making friends\, and learning many vital 
 school readiness skills. \n\nRegistration is required and is limited to 
 Glen Ridge residents. The parent/caregiver must be present in the library 
 during the class. Thank you for your cooperation.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Meeting Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Story Time
UID:LibCal-10286-17163425
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17163425
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261007T220000Z
DTEND:20261007T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261007T000000Z
SUMMARY:Library Chef: Apple and Goat Cheese Filo Triangles
DESCRIPTION:Light\, crispy\, golden filo triangles filled with sweet apples 
 and creamy goat cheese. This elegant sweet and savory appetizer looks fancy 
 but comes together fast. Perfect for entertaining or treating yourself to 
 something special.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Class
UID:LibCal-10286-17251927
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17251927
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261007T230000Z
DTEND:20261008T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261007T000000Z
SUMMARY:Library Chef: Cookbook Author Maria
DESCRIPTION:A special guest event! Join Maria\, a New Jersey author\, as 
 she shares her family culinary journey and cooking tips. Her memoir\, "On 
 the Rocks: The Primadonna Story\," is a heartfelt look at resilience\, 
 family\, and reinventing yourself after life's unexpected challenges.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Author Event/Talk
UID:LibCal-10286-17251885
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17251885
END:VEVENT
